{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1793372529,"nonce":"bR81Cp4QwJYxXSNDVspf935fO34=","title":"Sketch: an ordered input event queue and polled helpers","message":"Part of 6a1fd8c571c881f3ebaf5ab2d8b594620f364bc2fc335ce0f81fd72e477791b8.\n\n**Scope**\n\n`SketchContext.events`: pointer down, up and move (button, modifiers), wheel, key down and up with repeat, text input and IME composition, focus and blur, resize, in order, every transition kept between frames. Polled helpers (`mouseX`, `mouseY`, `pressed`, `keyIsDown`) built on the queue.\n\n**Done when**\n\nA press and release between two frames reach `draw` as two events; a test steps a sketch on the scheduler clock and checks the order.","files":null}]}